{
  "name": "KPL SAB 赛制 / KPL SAB League Format",
  "author": "L-ku",
  "version": "1.6.1",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "把中国赛区改成 KPL 的 S/A/B 分组赛制：每组三个单循环（45 场），每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组（含卡位赛 BO7），赛季末统一 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）加 7-10 名排位，推送最终名次与对阵新闻，并修正国际杯抽签的挂名队与重复席位。每个赛段开始（春季开档、夏季 6/22 转会期）先随机抽签分三组；第一轮显示为「KPL 一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起为 S 组/A 组/B 组，季后赛统一显示「KPL 季后赛」——命名只改显示层，不动联赛 ID、赛区和积分。底部「季后赛」按钮可展开完整 16 场对阵面板（轮次、日期时刻、队徽、实时比分），绕开原生页面只有 8 个卡位的问题，赛后推送当日战报。中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训队与新生成选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。S/A/B 为同一联赛级别，不再有 S↔A 升降级、降级履历或赞助层级惩罚；B↔K甲 升降级保留。\n\n1.6.1 修复能力值显示：引擎详情页 OVR 实际是「11 项技能值 + 主分路」的平均（自我不计入），旧版按 ovr/80 等比缩放，而五套分路模板均值只有 70-75，导致 91 分的选手只显示 81，且对抗路/游走偏低最多、球员排序会变。现改为按分路模板反解缩放系数并补齐零头，详情页 OVR 与名单评分完全一致，同时保留每个位置的强弱特征。\n1.6.0 统计窗口扩到 2023 春至 2026 夏共十季；荣誉改为在数据分之上加分（旧写法会让无冠选手凭空被扣 30%），补齐每届总决赛 FMVP 与赛季 MVP。结果：小胖 92、长生 92、轩染 91、一诺 90。\n1.5.0 能力值改为 11 项官方数据按分路加权、同赛季同分路取百分位，生涯荣誉按赛事等级与时间加权并入；挂名队禁止买人。\n1.4.0 16 队换成 2026 KPL 夏季赛真实大名单，年龄按真实出生日期、潜力按年龄区间随机；修复「同一支队每次开档选手不一样」。\n1.3.0 新增完整 16 场季后赛面板与每日战报。\n1.2.x S/A/B 同级、每赛段随机抽签、分组显示名。\n1.1.0 中国赛区全中文名。\n建议与 KPL + Real LoL Teams 数据包一起使用。\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: three single round-robins per group (45 matches), per-round standings reset with regrouping (plus BO7 card matches), and a unified 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff (16 matches) with 7-10 placement games. Final-rank and bracket news are pushed, and international-cup draws get their placeholder teams and duplicate seats fixed. Each split opens with a random draw into three groups (at save start for Spring, at the 6/22 transfer window for Summer); round 1 is labelled \"KPL Group 1/2/3\", rounds 2-3 use \"KPL S/A/B\", and playoffs always show \"KPL Playoffs\" — display-only, never touching league ids, regions or standings. A \"Playoffs\" button opens a full 16-match bracket panel (round, date/time, logos, live scores), working around the native pages' 8-slot limit, with a daily report after each playoff day. Every CN athlete (second division, academy and newly generated) gets a KPL-style Chinese name without changing stats. S, A and B share one league tier: no S-to-A promotion/relegation, relegation tags or tier-based sponsor penalties; B-to-K甲 promotion is kept.\n\n1.6.1 fixes the displayed rating: the engine computes OVR as the average of the eleven skill stats plus the main-lane stat (ego excluded), while the old code scaled the lane template by ovr/80 and the templates average only 70-75, so a 91-rated player showed as 81 and top/support players were penalised most, changing the sort order. The formula now solves the scale factor per lane and evens out rounding, so the in-game OVR matches the roster rating exactly while keeping each lane's character.\n1.6.0 extends the window to ten seasons (2023 Spring - 2026 Summer) and adds honours on top of the data score instead of scaling it (the old formula shaved 30% off every titleless player), covering every Finals MVP and season MVP. Results: 小胖 92, 长生 92, 轩染 91, 一诺 90.\n1.5.0 recomputes ratings from eleven official metrics, percentiled within season and lane with lane weights, folding in career honours weighted by event tier and recency; placeholder teams can no longer sign players.\n1.4.0 switches all 16 teams to the real 2026 KPL Summer roster, with real birth dates and age-banded random potential, and fixes rosters varying between saves.\n1.3.0 adds the full 16-match playoff panel and daily reports.\n1.2.x same tier for S/A/B, per-split random draw, group display names.\n1.1.0 Chinese names across the CN region.\nBest used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-20",
